abstract: >-
  Reproduction code for a secondary analysis of PatchDiff full-developer-test
  outcomes on resolved SWE-bench Verified patches. The package evaluates
  gold-aware patch-volume and file-scope audit signals, a gold-free fixed
  lexical/path triage baseline, and repository-level transportability.
